<title>GREECE: Greek mutual fund assets up 7.4pct in February.</title>
<headline>Greek mutual fund assets up 7.4pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Greek mutual fund industry's assets under management rose 7.4 percent to 4.57 trillion drachmas in February, the association of institutional investors said in its monthly review.</p>
<p>Fund assets are up 20 percent since the beginning of the year, an increase of 761 billion drachmas.</p>
<p>Bond funds made up 37.3 percent, money market funds 58.8 percent, growth funds 2.4 percent and balanced funds 1.4 percent.</p>
<p>Greece's 29 mutual fund management companies managed 150 funds, the association said.</p>
